@startuml
title Permit: revoked by whoever granted it -- the authority for an area, the venue owner for its own site
state "granted" as own
state "revoked" as ownRevoked
[*] --> granted : authority grants for an area (42)
granted --> revoked : authority revokes (43)
[*] --> own : venueOwner grants for its own site (44)
own --> ownRevoked : venueOwner revokes its own (45)
own -[dotted]-> ownRevoked : authority cannot revoke the venue's own (46)
[*] -[dotted]-> granted : promoter cannot grant (47)
revoked --> [*]
ownRevoked --> [*]
@enduml
